{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27347","headline":"闻高侍御卒贬所 · 李敬方","name":"闻高侍御卒贬所","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西京高院长，直气似吾徒。\n走马论边备，飞声感庙谟。\n官移人未察，身没事多符。\n寂寞他年後，名编野史无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李敬方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}